{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:19:03.085Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"我再调整一个边界：如果页面刷新后只有本地保存的钱包地址、没有实时 signer，支付按钮会先重新拉起 MetaMask 连接，再创建订单，避免异步请求后浏览器拦截钱包弹窗。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:19:03.085Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"我再调整一个边界：如果页面刷新后只有本地保存的钱包地址、没有实时 signer，支付按钮会先重新拉起 MetaMask 连接，再创建订单，避免异步请求后浏览器拦截钱包弹窗。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:19:07.384Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Tk78kvVqd4fWdzfFvHMouSRW","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/app.js\n@@\n async function payWithWallet() {\n   if (!state.walletAddress) {\n     state.walletError = \"Connect a Solana wallet before payment.\";\n     setView(\"wallet\");\n     return;\n   }\n+  if (!state.walletSigner) {\n+    state.paymentBusy = true;\n+    state.paymentError = \"\";\n+    state.paymentNotice = \"Opening MetaMask Solana to reconnect this wallet.\";\n+    render();\n+    try {\n+      await restorePaymentSigner();\n+    } catch (error) {\n+      state.paymentBusy = false;\n+      state.paymentError = error && error.message ? error.message : \"Reconnect MetaMask Solana before payment signing.\";\n+      render();\n+      return;\n+    }\n+    state.paymentBusy = false;\n+  }\n   if (!state.order) {\n     const order = await createPaymentOrder();\n     if (!order) return;\n   }\n*** End Patch\n"}}
