{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:26:53.865Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"我会把支付发送顺序改成：优先让钱包“只签名”，然后由网站把签名后的交易直接广播到 Solana 主网，并启用 `skipPreflight`。这样不走钱包的 signAndSend 预检路径；如果钱包不支持只签名，再回退到普通钱包发送。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:26:53.865Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"我会把支付发送顺序改成：优先让钱包“只签名”，然后由网站把签名后的交易直接广播到 Solana 主网，并启用 `skipPreflight`。这样不走钱包的 signAndSend 预检路径；如果钱包不支持只签名，再回退到普通钱包发送。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:26:59.929Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_wqiJt3IBrnlsKtrzMiymqqHF","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/app.js\n@@\n async function sendWithWalletStandard(tx) {\n   const feature = state.walletSigner?.features?.[\"solana:signAndSendTransaction\"];\n   if (!feature || typeof feature.signAndSendTransaction !== \"function\" || !state.walletAccount) {\n     return \"\";\n   }\n@@\n   const signature = result?.signature || result?.signatures?.[0];\n   return signature instanceof Uint8Array ? base58(signature) : signature || \"\";\n }\n \n+function signedTransactionBytes(result) {\n+  const candidate =\n+    result?.signedTransaction ||\n+    result?.transaction ||\n+    result?.signedTransactions?.[0] ||\n+    result?.transactions?.[0];\n+  if (candidate instanceof Uint8Array) return candidate;\n+  if (candidate?.serialize) return candidate.serialize();\n+  return null;\n+}\n+\n+async function sendWithWalletStandardSignOnly(tx, connection) {\n+  const feature = state.walletSigner?.features?.[\"solana:signTransaction\"];\n+  if (!feature || typeof feature.signTransaction !== \"function\" || !state.walletAccount) {\n+    return \"\";\n+  }\n+  const txBytes = tx.serialize({ requireAllSignatures: false, verifySignatures: false });\n+  const result = await feature.signTransaction({\n+    account: state.walletAccount,\n+    chain: solanaChain,\n+    transaction: txBytes,\n+  });\n+  const signedBytes = signedTransactionBytes(result);\n+  if (!signedBytes) return \"\";\n+  return connection.sendRawTransaction(signedBytes, {\n+    skipPreflight: true,\n+    maxRetries: 5,\n+  });\n+}\n+\n async function sendWithInjectedWallet(tx, connection) {\n   const provider = state.walletSigner;\n   if (!provider) return \"\";\n   if (typeof provider.signAndSendTransaction === \"function\") {\n     const result = await provider.signAndSendTransaction(tx);\n@@\n   }\n   if (typeof provider.signTransaction === \"function\") {\n     const signed = await provider.signTransaction(tx);\n     const signature = await connection.sendRawTransaction(signed.serialize(), {\n-      skipPreflight: false,\n+      skipPreflight: true,\n       preflightCommitment: \"confirmed\",\n+      maxRetries: 5,\n     });\n     return signature;\n   }\n   return \"\";\n }\n@@\n     await restorePaymentSigner();\n     const { tx, connection } = await buildUsdtPaymentTransaction(state.order);\n-    state.paymentNotice = \"Opening MetaMask. Confirm the 0.5 USDT transfer in the wallet popup.\";\n+    state.paymentNotice = \"Opening MetaMask. Sign the real 0.5 USDT mainnet payment.\";\n     render();\n-    let signature = await sendWithWalletStandard(tx);\n+    let signature = await sendWithWalletStandardSignOnly(tx, connection);\n+    if (!signature) signature = await sendWithWalletStandard(tx);\n     if (!signature) signature = await sendWithInjectedWallet(tx, connection);\n     if (!signature) throw new Error(\"Connected wallet does not support transaction signing.\");\n*** End Patch\n"}}
