{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:26:02.452Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"为了满足“钱包里收款地址显示 `7Ms...`”这个要求，我会同时加一个真实主网手动付款闭环：网站生成订单后显示官方钱包地址、金额和 USDT Mint；你在 MetaMask 原生 Send 页面选择 Solana USDT 发到 `7Ms...`，然后把交易签名贴回网站验证解锁。这个方式不会出现 dApp 交易里 `244m...` 的 token account 展示。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:26:02.452Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"为了满足“钱包里收款地址显示 `7Ms...`”这个要求，我会同时加一个真实主网手动付款闭环：网站生成订单后显示官方钱包地址、金额和 USDT Mint；你在 MetaMask 原生 Send 页面选择 Solana USDT 发到 `7Ms...`，然后把交易签名贴回网站验证解锁。这个方式不会出现 dApp 交易里 `244m...` 的 token account 展示。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:26:10.806Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_27SVzcKi65qw5oFmjv5DxkhA","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/server.mjs\n@@\n-    if (!hasSigner(tx, order.walletAddress)) continue;\n-    if (!includesMemo(tx, order.memo)) continue;\n+    if (!hasSigner(tx, order.walletAddress)) continue;\n+    if (!submittedSignature && !includesMemo(tx, order.memo)) continue;\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/app.js\n@@\n   paymentError: \"\",\n   paymentNotice: \"\",\n+  manualSignature: \"\",\n   walletReadiness: null,\n };\n@@\n async function verifyPayment() {\n   if (!state.order) return;\n   state.paymentBusy = true;\n   state.paymentError = \"\";\n   state.paymentNotice = \"\";\n@@\n     const payload = await api(`/api/orders/${state.order.id}/verify`, {\n       method: \"POST\",\n-      body: JSON.stringify({ signature: state.order.signature || \"\" }),\n+      body: JSON.stringify({ signature: state.manualSignature.trim() || state.order.signature || \"\" }),\n     });\n@@\n }\n+\n+function setManualSignature(value) {\n+  state.manualSignature = value.trim();\n+}\n@@\n async function copyPaymentAddress() {\n   const value = state.order ? `${state.order.recipient}` : \"7MsAkdANC9d9MxRz1G1nndz1F8TnHnWsZBFp2EVQiYE9\";\n   await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);\n }\n+\n+async function copyManualPaymentDetails() {\n+  if (!state.order) await createPaymentOrder();\n+  if (!state.order) return;\n+  await navigator.clipboard.writeText(\n+    [\n+      \"Network: Solana Mainnet\",\n+      `Token: USDT (${state.order.usdtMint})`,\n+      `Recipient wallet: ${state.order.recipient}`,\n+      `Amount: ${state.order.amount} ${state.order.token}`,\n+      `Order memo: ${state.order.memo}`,\n+    ].join(\"\\n\"),\n+  );\n+  state.paymentNotice = \"Payment details copied. Send Solana USDT from MetaMask, then paste the transaction signature here.\";\n+  render();\n+}\n@@\n                 <div><span>Amount</span><strong>${state.order.amount} ${state.order.token}</strong></div>\n                 <div><span>Network</span><strong>${state.order.chain}</strong></div>\n                 <div><span>USDT Mint</span><code>${state.order.usdtMint}</code></div>\n-                <div><span>Recipient</span><code>${state.order.recipient}</code></div>\n+                <div><span>Official receiver wallet</span><code>${state.order.recipient}</code></div>\n                 <div><span>Memo</span><code>${state.order.memo}</code></div>\n                 <div><span>Status</span><strong>${state.order.status}</strong></div>\n                 ${state.order.signature ? `<div><span>Signature</span><code>${state.order.signature}</code></div>` : \"\"}\n               </div>`\n@@\n           ${state.order ? `<button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"verifyPayment()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"check\")} Verify Payment</button>` : \"\"}\n           ${state.order ? `<button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"copyPaymentAddress()\">Copy recipient address</button>` : \"\"}\n           <button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"connectWallet()\">Reconnect MetaMask Solana</button>\n         </div>\n+        ${\n+          state.order\n+            ? `<div class=\"manual-pay-box\">\n+                <h2>Manual real payment</h2>\n+                <p>Use MetaMask Send: Solana Mainnet, USDT, recipient wallet ${state.order.recipient}, amount ${state.order.amount} USDT. Then paste the confirmed transaction signature below.</p>\n+                <button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"copyManualPaymentDetails()\">${icon(\"card\")} Copy manual payment details</button>\n+                <input class=\"signature-input\" placeholder=\"Paste Solana transaction signature\" value=\"${state.manualSignature}\" oninput=\"setManualSignature(this.value)\" />\n+                <button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"verifyPayment()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"check\")} Verify pasted signature</button>\n+              </div>`\n+            : \"\"\n+        }\n*** End Patch\n"}}
