{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:31:54.795Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"我确认了错误原因：页面上仍保留 `Pay 0.5 USDT with Wallet` 按钮，它会继续触发 dApp 交易请求，所以必然还是出现这个 MetaMask simulation 页面。纠正方式是把这个按钮从支付闭环中移除，主流程改为“生成订单 -> 在 MetaMask 原生 Send 真实转 USDT 到 7Ms... -> 粘贴交易签名验证”。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:31:54.795Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"我确认了错误原因：页面上仍保留 `Pay 0.5 USDT with Wallet` 按钮，它会继续触发 dApp 交易请求，所以必然还是出现这个 MetaMask simulation 页面。纠正方式是把这个按钮从支付闭环中移除，主流程改为“生成订单 -> 在 MetaMask 原生 Send 真实转 USDT 到 7Ms... -> 粘贴交易签名验证”。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:32:05.879Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ViU0FWOVUPtX6L58cLpaOCbm","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/server.mjs\n@@\n   for (const item of signatures) {\n     const signature = item.signature || item;\n+    const isSubmittedSignature = Boolean(submittedSignature) && signature === submittedSignature;\n     const tx = await rpc(\"getTransaction\", [\n       signature,\n       { encoding: \"jsonParsed\", commitment: \"confirmed\", maxSupportedTransactionVersion: 0 },\n     ]);\n     if (!tx || tx.meta?.err) continue;\n     if (!hasSigner(tx, order.walletAddress)) continue;\n-    if (!submittedSignature && !includesMemo(tx, order.memo)) continue;\n+    if (!isSubmittedSignature && !includesMemo(tx, order.memo)) continue;\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/app.js\n@@\n             ? `<div class=\"payment-box\">\n                 <div><span>Amount</span><strong>${state.order.amount} ${state.order.token}</strong></div>\n                 <div><span>Network</span><strong>${state.order.chain}</strong></div>\n                 <div><span>USDT Mint</span><code>${state.order.usdtMint}</code></div>\n                 <div><span>Official receiver wallet</span><code>${state.order.recipient}</code></div>\n-                <div><span>Memo</span><code>${state.order.memo}</code></div>\n+                <div><span>Order memo</span><code>${state.order.memo}</code></div>\n                 <div><span>Status</span><strong>${state.order.status}</strong></div>\n                 ${state.order.signature ? `<div><span>Signature</span><code>${state.order.signature}</code></div>` : \"\"}\n               </div>`\n             : `<div class=\"payment-box muted-box\">\n-                <p>Order will be created with a unique memo and reference. The backend validates USDT mint, receiver wallet, amount, wallet signer, and memo before unlocking download.</p>\n+                <p>Create an order first. Then pay from MetaMask Send on Solana Mainnet and paste the confirmed transaction signature to unlock download.</p>\n               </div>`\n         }\n-        <div class=\"button-stack\">\n-          <button class=\"primary pay\" onclick=\"pay()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"wallet\")} ${state.order ? \"Pay 0.5 USDT with Wallet\" : \"Create Payment Order\"}</button>\n-          ${state.order ? `<button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"verifyPayment()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"check\")} Verify Payment</button>` : \"\"}\n-          ${state.order ? `<button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"copyPaymentAddress()\">Copy recipient address</button>` : \"\"}\n-          <button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"connectWallet()\">Reconnect MetaMask Solana</button>\n-        </div>\n         ${\n           state.order\n             ? `<div class=\"manual-pay-box\">\n-                <h2>Manual real payment</h2>\n-                <p>Use MetaMask Send: Solana Mainnet, USDT, recipient wallet ${state.order.recipient}, amount ${state.order.amount} USDT. Then paste the confirmed transaction signature below.</p>\n-                <button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"copyManualPaymentDetails()\">${icon(\"card\")} Copy manual payment details</button>\n+                <h2>Real mainnet payment</h2>\n+                <p>Open MetaMask Send manually. Select Solana Mainnet and USDT. Send exactly ${state.order.amount} USDT to official wallet ${state.order.recipient}. Paste the confirmed transaction signature below.</p>\n+                <button class=\"primary pay\" onclick=\"copyManualPaymentDetails()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"card\")} Copy payment details</button>\n                 <input class=\"signature-input\" placeholder=\"Paste Solana transaction signature\" value=\"${state.manualSignature}\" oninput=\"setManualSignature(this.value)\" />\n                 <button class=\"secondary neutral\" onclick=\"verifyPayment()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"check\")} Verify pasted signature</button>\n+                <button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"copyPaymentAddress()\">Copy recipient address only</button>\n               </div>`\n-            : \"\"\n+            : `<div class=\"button-stack\">\n+                <button class=\"primary pay\" onclick=\"createPaymentOrder()\" ${state.paymentBusy ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>${icon(\"card\")} Create real payment order</button>\n+                <button class=\"text-link\" onclick=\"connectWallet()\">Reconnect MetaMask Solana</button>\n+              </div>`\n         }\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/index.html\n@@\n-    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./styles.css?v=20260523-manual-mainnet-pay\" />\n+    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./styles.css?v=20260523-manual-only-pay\" />\n@@\n-    <script src=\"./app.js?v=20260523-manual-mainnet-pay\"></script>\n+    <script src=\"./app.js?v=20260523-manual-only-pay\"></script>\n*** End Patch\n"}}
