{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:45:42.166Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"方案 A 的关键修正我会做两点：第一，恢复“Pay with MetaMask”主按钮；第二，把接收 USDT 账户创建指令从 `idempotent` 改成普通 ATA 创建，并且只有接收账户不存在时才添加，减少 MetaMask simulation 失败概率。支付前也先校验当前连接的钱包确实有 SOL 和 USDT。","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:45:42.166Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"方案 A 的关键修正我会做两点：第一，恢复“Pay with MetaMask”主按钮；第二，把接收 USDT 账户创建指令从 `idempotent` 改成普通 ATA 创建，并且只有接收账户不存在时才添加，减少 MetaMask simulation 失败概率。支付前也先校验当前连接的钱包确实有 SOL 和 USDT。"}],"phase":"commentary"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:45:49.092Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_hmlWWhA8CNNMADE08rPmcGyr","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /Users/vincet/Documents/aiglass/aigame-dock/app.js\n@@\n   const sourceAta = await splToken.getAssociatedTokenAddress(mint, payer);\n   const recipientAta = await splToken.getAssociatedTokenAddress(mint, recipient);\n   const amount = BigInt(Math.round(Number(order.amount) * 10 ** 6));\n   const tx = new web3.Transaction();\n \n-  const createAtaInstruction =\n-    splToken.createAssociatedTokenAccountIdempotentInstruction ||\n-    splToken.createAssociatedTokenAccountInstruction;\n-  tx.add(createAtaInstruction(payer, recipientAta, recipient, mint));\n+  const sourceAccount = await connection.getAccountInfo(sourceAta, \"confirmed\");\n+  if (!sourceAccount) {\n+    throw new Error(\"This MetaMask Solana account has no SPL USDT token account.\");\n+  }\n+\n+  const sourceBalance = await connection.getTokenAccountBalance(sourceAta, \"confirmed\");\n+  const sourceAmount = BigInt(sourceBalance.value.amount || \"0\");\n+  if (sourceAmount < amount) {\n+    throw new Error(`Insufficient Solana USDT balance. Need ${order.amount} USDT in this wallet.`);\n+  }\n+\n+  const recipientAccount = await connection.getAccountInfo(recipientAta, \"confirmed\");\n+  if (!recipientAccount) {\n+    tx.add(splToken.createAssociatedTokenAccountInstruction(payer, recipientAta, recipient, mint));\n+  }\n   tx.add(\n     splToken.createTransferCheckedInstruction(\n       sourceAta,\n@@\n   return { tx, connection };\n }\n@@\n function signedTransactionBytes(result) {\n@@\n   return null;\n }\n+\n+async function sendWithWalletStandard(tx) {\n+  const feature = state.walletSigner?.features?.[\"solana:signAndSendTransaction\"];\n+  if (!feature || typeof feature.signAndSendTransaction !== \"function\" || !state.walletAccount) {\n+    return \"\";\n+  }\n+  const txBytes = tx.serialize({ requireAllSignatures: false, verifySignatures: false });\n+  const result = await feature.signAndSendTransaction({\n+    account: state.walletAccount,\n+    chain: solanaChain,\n+    transaction: txBytes,\n+  });\n+  const value = Array.isArray(result) ? result[0] : result;\n+  const signature = value?.signature || value?.signatures?.[0];\n+  return signature instanceof Uint8Array ? base58(signature) : signature || \"\";\n+}\n \n async function sendWithWalletStandardSignOnly(tx, connection) {\n@@\n   try {\n     await restorePaymentSigner();\n+    await checkWalletReadiness();\n     const { tx, connection } = await buildUsdtPaymentTransaction(state.order);\n-    state.paymentNotice = \"Opening MetaMask. Sign the real 0.5 USDT mainnet payment.\";\n+    state.paymentNotice = \"Opening MetaMask. Confirm the real 0.5 USDT mainnet payment.\";\n     render();\n-    let signature = await sendWithWalletStandardSignOnly(tx, connection);\n+    let signature = await sendWithWalletStandard(tx);\n+    if (!signature) signature = await sendWithWalletStandardSignOnly(tx, connection);\n     if (!signature) signature = await sendWithInjectedWallet(tx, connection);\n-    if (!signature) throw new Error(\"MetaMask Solana did not expose signTransaction. Reconnect MetaMask Solana and try again.\");\n+    if (!signature) throw new Error(\"MetaMask Solana did not expose a supported transaction signing method. Reconnect MetaMask Solana and try again.\");\n*** End Patch\n"}}
